    "description": "ScriptSyncPilot pattern insertion trial. Each section is an independent pattern/range variant; sections are separated by a one-second transition.\nTriangle uses equal up/down timing. Fast-up/slow-down allocates 30% of each cycle to the upstroke and 70% to the downstroke. Ease-near-turnarounds uses a sampled cosine profile.\nSections (start-end, cycles, duration, min-max):\nSystem.String[]",
